    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(on_deck_package_id,ordinal)`及`UNIQUE(on_deck_package_id,material_key)`",
      "一个Physical Material在同一Product Manifest只有一个业务role，ordinal从0连续且至少一个primary，只有primary允许Episode relation",
      "完整Physical Identity/Location/Binding/Requirement/Evidence可重建Product Material Manifest。direct input的`digest_algorithm=middle-256k-sha256,digest_hex=content_fingerprint`",
      "系统生成Workspace output的`digest_algorithm=sha256,digest_hex`来自原写入流的独立Artifact digest且不得参与materialKey。`output_requirement_digest`必须按8.6.21从Package/Run共同引用的immutable Acceptance Spec及本Product member/relation重算并逐字节等于Manifest",
      "assert variant固定domain location/Libra Binding，origin Delivery列全非NULL、Workspace/root-relative列全NULL且expected Control非NULL，其Physical Identity/Location/Binding/origin/expected Control逐项命中Run Input，Requirement因`manifestRole=product_delivery`按正式公式重新派生",
      "acquire variant固定workspace location/Workspace Reference，origin/location列为NULL而root/relative及typed Handle JSON≤`4 KiB`逐字节命中current Product Staging Reference、expected Control为空并在Promotion事务取得revision 1",
      "member/set digest按8.6.21唯一公式"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`on_deck_package_id FK, ordinal, material_handle_id NULL, material_key, role(primary_payload|structural_dependency|metadata_sidecar|poster|fanart|subtitle|external_audio|chapter), mount_scope_id, inode, fingerprint_algorithm, fingerprint_version, content_fingerprint, location_kind(domain_binding|workspace_handle), endpoint_id, location NULL, root_handle_ref NULL, relative_path NULL, binding_kind(libra_material_binding|workspace_material_reference), binding_revision, binding_evidence_digest, origin_intake_decision_id NULL FK, origin_offer_id NULL, origin_candidate_package_id NULL, origin_package_revision NULL, origin_package_digest NULL, origin_candidate_delivery_snapshot_digest NULL, origin_related_reference_set_digest NULL, workspace_reference_id NULL, workspace_handle_schema_ref NULL, workspace_handle_json NULL, workspace_handle_digest NULL, output_requirement_digest, episode_claim_set_digest, digest_algorithm, digest_hex, size_bytes, control_operation(assert_existing_input|acquire_workspace_product), expected_control_revision NULL, expected_control_projection_digest NULL, committed_control_revision, committed_control_projection_digest, member_digest`",
      "constraints": "`PK(on_deck_package_id,ordinal)`及`UNIQUE(on_deck_package_id,material_key)`；一个Physical Material在同一Product Manifest只有一个业务role，ordinal从0连续且至少一个primary，只有primary允许Episode relation；完整Physical Identity/Location/Binding/Requirement/Evidence可重建Product Material Manifest。direct input的`digest_algorithm=middle-256k-sha256,digest_hex=content_fingerprint`；系统生成Workspace output的`digest_algorithm=sha256,digest_hex`来自原写入流的独立Artifact digest且不得参与materialKey。`output_requirement_digest`必须按8.6.21从Package/Run共同引用的immutable Acceptance Spec及本Product member/relation重算并逐字节等于Manifest；assert variant固定domain location/Libra Binding，origin Delivery列全非NULL、Workspace/root-relative列全NULL且expected Control非NULL，其Physical Identity/Location/Binding/origin/expected Control逐项命中Run Input，Requirement因`manifestRole=product_delivery`按正式公式重新派生；acquire variant固定workspace location/Workspace Reference，origin/location列为NULL而root/relative及typed Handle JSON≤`4 KiB`逐字节命中current Product Staging Reference、expected Control为空并在Promotion事务取得revision 1；member/set digest按8.6.21唯一公式"
